<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>BM Draw Stance </Major>
    <Description>BM Draw Stance Daze Rotation

This macro works when you are in "Draw Stance" and when party needed daze on boss, quickly switch "Draw Stance" to "Basic Stance" daze to boss and quickly come back to "Draw Stance" again.

Enjoy!</Description>
    <Comment>https://keyran.net - Free macros download </Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 8 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyUp 8 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyDown 6 1
Delay 100
KeyUp 6 1
Delay 100
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 120 ms
KeyDown 43 1
Delay 100 ms
KeyUp 43 1
Delay 100 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Blade &amp; Soul</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>